dialogue prologue_road
title: The Road to Tithe
trigger: Prologue Travel
backdrop: greenvalley
speaker commander $commander
speaker knight knight
speaker barbarian barbarian

node sky commander
  Wind, heather and a grey sky. Far off, the Manalith hangs over the moor, bigger than the Moorfolk say it used to be.
  -> road

node road knight
  Tithe is down this road. Half a day if the weather holds.
  -> heather

node heather barbarian
  Something's moving in the heather. Wolves. Stay close to the cart.
